#question(title: [Proof feedback])[
  + Does your proof have the correct
    structure?
  + Are all your variables fixed (not
    quantified)? In the right order? Do you
    know what depends on what?
  + Is the proof self-contained? Or do I need
    to read the rough work to understand it?
  + Does each statement follow logically from
    previous statements?
  + Did you explain what you were doing?
    Would your reader be able to follow your
    thought process without reading your
    mind?
]
